From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:04:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Trips: fuller intake and patient record, payors listed
 once, quoted time, MDT, ePCR feed

Intake records the call, rooms and phones at both ends, ICD-10 diagnoses,
oxygen, stairs, riders, DNR, doctors, PCS requested/signed and wait-and-return,
and looks the patient up when you tab off the name or date of birth. ASAP trips
can carry a quoted time that isn't a pickup time. Patients get name parts,
